  {
    "text": "The book \"Mémoires et Histoire : tensions, enjeux et fonctions sociales\" was edited by Hedi Saidi and coordinated by Sofiene Ben Moussa, Manel Kanzali, Mihaela Daciana Natea, Hafedh Ben Hassine, and Simion Costea.",
    "topic": "memory"
  },
  {
    "text": "The book includes a preface by Emmanuel Jovelin and an avant-propos by Adel Bouzid.",
    "topic": "memory"
  },
  {
    "text": "The book is based on an international colloquium held in Sousse, Tunisia, from April 17 to 19, 2025, in honor of Hedi Saidi.",
    "topic": "memory"
  },
  {
    "text": "The publication is part of the \"Diversités\" collection and was published by L'Harmattan in Paris in 2026.",
    "topic": "memory"
  },
  {
    "text": "The ISBN of the book is 978-2-336-60933-1.",
    "topic": "memory"
  }
]
